          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c1_deep_learning_depends_huge_datasets",
          "text": "Deep learning depends on huge datasets that are costly to store, preprocess, and train on. Dataset distillation compresses a dataset into a tiny synthetic one that still trains high-accuracy models. This paper introduces SPEED, Sparse Parameterization for Epitomic dataset Distillation.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "deep",
            "learning",
            "depends",
            "huge",
            "datasets",
            "costly",
            "store",
            "preprocess",
            "train",
            "dataset"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_instead_tuning_matching_objective_li",
          "text": "Instead of tuning the matching objective like most prior work, SPEED rethinks how the synthetic dataset itself is parameterized.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "instead",
            "tuning",
            "matching",
            "objective",
            "like",
            "most",
            "prior",
            "work",
            "speed",
            "rethinks"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_borrows_ideas_dictionary_learning_sp",
          "text": "It borrows ideas from dictionary learning and sparse coding: a shared pool of spatial-agnostic epitomic tokens acts as a dictionary, sparse coding matrices pick the significant tokens per image, and a feature-recurrent network reassembles them into high-resolution synthetic images.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "borrows",
            "ideas",
            "dictionary",
            "learning",
            "sparse",
            "coding",
            "shared",
            "pool",
            "spatial-agnostic",
            "epitomic"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c4_result_state_of_the_art_distillation",
          "text": "The result is state-of-the-art distillation, especially on high-resolution ImageNet subsets, with a fraction of the storage.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "result",
            "state-of-the-art",
            "distillation",
            "especially",
            "high-resolution",
            "imagenet",
