          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c2_stress_high_resolution_performance_s",
          "text": "To stress high-resolution performance, it uses six ImageNet subsets at one-twenty-eight by one-twenty-eight, each with ten classes: ImageNette, ImageWoof, ImageFruit, ImageMeow, ImageSquawk, and ImageYellow.",
