          "chunk_id": "s06_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s06_c1_headline_clean_sweep_across_all",
          "text": "The headline is a clean sweep. Across all three standard benchmarks and all six high-resolution ImageNet subsets, SPEED sets new state-of-the-art.",
