          "chunk_id": "s06_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s06_c2_tightest_one_image_per_class_budget",
          "text": "At the tightest one-image-per-class budget, it reaches forty percent on CIFAR-100, a six point gain, and twenty-six point nine percent on TinyImageNet, a ten point nine gain over the previous best.",
