          "chunk_id": "s06_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s06_c3_imagenet_subsets_averages_eleven_poi",
          "text": "On the ImageNet subsets it averages an eleven point two percent improvement at the same budget. Strikingly, its one-image-per-class results match what prior methods needed ten images per class to achieve, using only about ten percent of their storage.",
