          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c3_push_too_low_down_twelve",
          "text": "Push k too low, down to twelve, and accuracy collapses, so a moderate value is best and even improves cross-architecture generalization. On the network side, two recurrent blocks and three heads work best.",
