          "chunk_id": "s08_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s08_c2_treating_synthetic_dataset_shared_di",
          "text": "By treating a synthetic dataset as a shared dictionary of spatial-agnostic epitomic tokens, sparse per-image coding matrices, and a small recurrent network that reassembles them, SPEED removes the spatial redundancy that naive methods leave on the table.",
